The main changes are:
1. Added length checks before trying to read the sequence number (buf.readableBytes() >= 6)
2. Added proper handling of the sequence number reading in various code paths
3. Added more conservative handling of message endings

These changes should resolve the IndexOutOfBoundsException while maintaining the protocol functionality.

